<td title="Reported Fault" style="white-space: nowrap ;  " class="longparagraph">

Gantry fault

</td>

<td title="Fault Description" style="white-space: nowrap ;  " class="longparagraph">

Unable to gantry the crane due to land side wheel brake LS fault

</td>

<td title="Corrective Action" style="white-space: nowrap ;  " class="longparagraph">

When physically checking, it was observed that land side all wheel brakes were not opened properly.Then checked the land side wheel brake hydraulic station and it was noticed that the land side wheel brake pump was not pressurized to its required value. Due to yard RTG recovering process and QC05 fault, the land side wheel brake pump was manually opened, and the pump was switched off from its MCB.Need to inspect this

</td>

<td title="Remark" style="white-space: nowrap ;  " class="longparagraph">


</td>

